Package: llvm-vle-ppc
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: LLVM compiler infrastructure with PowerPC VLE support
 LLVM is a collection of modular and reusable compiler and toolchain
 technologies. This package provides LLVM with PowerPC VLE (Variable Length
 Encoding) support enabled for e200z4/e200z6/e200z7 cores.
 .
 This package includes:
  - LLVM core libraries and tools
  - Clang C/C++ compiler frontend
  - LLD linker
  - Support for powerpc-none-eabivle and powerpc-unknown-linux-gnu triplets
  - VLE instruction encoding for embedded PowerPC applications

Package: llvm-vle-ppc-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: llvm-vle-ppc (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development files for LLVM with PowerPC VLE support
 This package provides development headers and libraries for building
 applications with LLVM PowerPC VLE support.

